WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.819
Breaking news special. Twenty-eleven universal time. When cellular masts and command centres lose power, emergency response cannot rely on a centralised server.

2
00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:20.918
We present the full investigation into SENDA, the cybernetic and geospatial platform that preserves emergency communications and sovereign territorial defence.

3
00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:31.969
The data speaks clearly. In the Valencia disaster of October twenty twenty-four, mast collapses left hundreds of thousands isolated in rising floodwaters.

4
00:00:32.319 --> 00:00:43.241
In the Bejís wildfire and the sudden fog of the A-12 highway in Arnhem, the absence of direct communications multiplied the danger. SENDA was built to solve this critical gap.

5
00:00:44.841 --> 00:00:55.999
Operating seamlessly across license-free bands at four hundred thirty-three and eight hundred sixty-eight megahertz, Bluetooth and two point four gigahertz, SENDA forms a resilient ad-hoc mesh.

6
00:00:56.349 --> 00:01:07.591
Every vehicle, phone, and community node stores and forwards encrypted packets compliant with the European DATEX II standard and civil protection guidelines, ensuring reach without internet.

7
00:01:09.191 --> 00:01:19.218
System resilience rests on proven mathematics: the Al-Hourani air-to-ground model, Deygout terrain diffraction, and the graph Laplacian lambda-two Fiedler eigenvalue.

8
00:01:19.568 --> 00:01:30.981
Furthermore, through the cross-ambiguity function of passive bistatic radar, the network detects aircraft Doppler reflections using ambient commercial broadcasts already present in the atmosphere.

9
00:01:32.581 --> 00:01:43.163
Any command post or community group can assemble a tactical sensor using ESP32 microcontrollers and low-cost radio receivers for under twenty-five euros.

10
00:01:43.513 --> 00:01:54.755
Using copper-wire antennas and the ASTM F3411 decoder, SENDA tracks unauthorized drones in flight and reveals the exact ground coordinates of their remote pilot.

11
00:01:56.355 --> 00:02:04.099
Investor mode provides governments with a high-value sovereign asset for civil defence, national resilience, and disaster preparedness.

12
00:02:04.449 --> 00:02:16.097
Developer mode provides an open modular architecture across seventy-four verified packages, while citizen mode delivers an emergency application working offline from the very first second.

13
00:02:17.697 --> 00:02:27.255
SENDA is not a future promise: it is an operational real-time deployment, verified with strict mathematics and open technology to protect lives everywhere.

14
00:02:27.605 --> 00:02:35.477
Explore the interactive platform and inspect the digital twin at civic-relay-investor dot vercel dot app slash senda.
